{"assets":["/statement-assets/89b9743ec0cf20c548699da040caa3ff89943b789203654b457063921d818d4e.png","/statement-assets/96f82d63fa4c8fb56085ea768ab6366f6f1365e037ef9c5b3b9128732489cff5.png","/statement-assets/807bcb902207e5629ecd736ec2f4f30a34b9f39b8410d5f9d413fd4b30910317.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"516","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Drazil and His Happy Friends"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Drazil has many friends. Some of them are happy and some of them are unhappy. Drazil wants to make all his friends become happy. So he invented the following plan."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" boys and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" girls among his friends. Let's number them from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" separately. In "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th day, Drazil invites "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/89b9743ec0cf20c548699da040caa3ff89943b789203654b457063921d818d4e.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th boy and "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/96f82d63fa4c8fb56085ea768ab6366f6f1365e037ef9c5b3b9128732489cff5.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th girl to have dinner together (as Drazil is programmer, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" starts from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":"). If one of those two people is happy, the other one will also become happy. Otherwise, those two people remain in their states. Once a person becomes happy (or if it is happy originally), he stays happy forever."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Drazil wants to know on which day all his friends become happy or to determine if they won't become all happy at all."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, m ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ b ≤ min(n, 105)"},{"kind":"text","text":"), denoting the number of happy boys among friends of Drazil, and then follow "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" distinct integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x1, x2, ..., xb"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ xi < n"},{"kind":"text","text":"), denoting the list of indices of happy boys."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line conatins integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"g"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ g ≤ min(m, 105)"},{"kind":"text","text":"), denoting the number of happy girls among friends of Drazil, and then follow "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"g"},{"kind":"text","text":" distinct integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y1, y2, ... , yg"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ yj < m"},{"kind":"text","text":"), denoting the list of indices of happy girls."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that there is at least one person that is unhappy among his friends."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the number of the first day that all friends of Drazil become happy. If this day won't come at all, you print -1."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 3\n0\n1 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 4\n1 0\n1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 3\n1 0\n1 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"99999 100000\n2 514 415\n2 50216 61205\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4970100515\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"By "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/807bcb902207e5629ecd736ec2f4f30a34b9f39b8410d5f9d413fd4b30910317.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" we define the remainder of integer division of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In first sample case: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" On the 0-th day, Drazil invites 0-th boy and 0-th girl. Because 0-th girl is happy at the beginning, 0-th boy become happy at this day. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" On the 1-st day, Drazil invites 1-st boy and 1-st girl. They are both unhappy, so nothing changes at this day. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" On the 2-nd day, Drazil invites 0-th boy and 2-nd girl. Because 0-th boy is already happy he makes 2-nd girl become happy at this day. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" On the 3-rd day, Drazil invites 1-st boy and 0-th girl. 0-th girl is happy, so she makes 1-st boy happy. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" On the 4-th day, Drazil invites 0-th boy and 1-st girl. 0-th boy is happy, so he makes the 1-st girl happy. So, all friends become happy at this moment. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"516E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/516/problem/E"}